     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">No, but if<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">y </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> rbind</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> NA</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> NA</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> NA</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">NA</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> NA</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> NA</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><br>then<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">y_1 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> which</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">y </span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> arr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ind </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>y_0 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> which</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">y </span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> arr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ind </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>yNA </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> which</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">is</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">na</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">y</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> arr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ind </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><br>would be a start.<br><br>Ben</div>"
